WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.899 line:92% position:50% size:90%
A clear chart starts

00:00:01.899 --> 00:00:03.619 line:92% position:50% size:90%
with one useful observation.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.787 line:92% position:50% size:90%
First, check the market you are viewing.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.606 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Choose one timeframe before adding any drawings.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.946 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Look for a price area

00:00:18.946 --> 00:00:20.358 line:92% position:50% size:90%
you want to observe.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.212 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Select H-Line in the drawing toolbar.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.730 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Click once on the chart

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.970 line:92% position:50% size:90%
to mark that level.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.927 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Pause and check where your line landed.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.914 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Return to Cursor when you finish drawing.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.294 line:92% position:50% size:90%
A marked level does not

00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:50.985 line:92% position:50% size:90%
guarantee a price reaction.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.187 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Practise marking one level, then

00:00:56.187 --> 00:00:58.194 line:92% position:50% size:90%
explain why you chose it.
